# Dataset + generated artifacts are large binaries — regenerate locally with
# scripts/extract_azsl_model.py rather than committing them.
AzSLD_Fingerspelling.zip
data/
public/models/*.task
# public/models/azsl_hierarchical_model.json is small (~470KB) and IS meant to
# be committed so the frontend has a model to fetch without re-running
# extraction. It lives under public/ so `vite build` copies it into dist/ —
# moving it back out of public/ will 404 in production (fetch falls back to
# index.html via Vite's SPA fallback and silently disables the classifier).

*.zip
